@Sjors the new tests cover the cases in my tACK except two: a changed v2 input sequence and a corrupted signature. In both the wallet's transaction stays as it was and `walletprocesspsbt` returns an incomplete PSBT, which a test could pin.

The probe and its output: https://gist.github.com/fametrano/e808f936324f16573f74e5f0f3aadf02

I re-ran it on the new head and `wallet_signer.py` passes. tACK dc30c41f9b29bbae1eed172155e23ade03717849

